OL,3,GNEWSABurnage priest lands unexpected
OL,4,Arole in Oasis film
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Burnage priest whose sermon on
OL,7,Fforgiveness featured in the new Oasis
OL,8,Fdocumentary has described the "bizarre"
OL,9,Fexperience of walking the red carpet at
OL,10,Fits London premiere.
OL,12,FFather Luke Bradbury, from St Bernard's
OL,13,FChurch, briefly appears in the film
OL,14,FDon't Look Back In Anger, which charts
OL,15,Fthe band's 2025 reunion tour after
OL,16,Fyears of acrimony between siblings Liam
OL,17,Fand Noel Gallagher.
