OL,3,GNEWSABurnage priest lands unexpected
OL,4,Arole in Oasis film
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe documentary crew wanted to film at
OL,7,Fthe church close to where the brothers
OL,8,Fappeared in a nativity play as boys, in
OL,9,Fa nod to their devout Irish Catholic
OL,10,Fmother Peggy.
OL,12,F"I was asked if they could film and we
OL,13,Fhad no problem," said Father Bradbury.
